# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw source data
#
# The 296 official NBS / NERC / CBN source files stay on disk but are NOT
# committed: they are large binary artifacts (~1.2 GB) obtained from public
# official sources. Their provenance, coverage and SHA-256 integrity are
# documented under docs/acquisition/, which IS tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/**
!data/raw/README.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.ipynb_checkpoints/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment, secrets and database credentials
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
.pgpass
.psql_history
credentials.json
*.pem
*.key

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local database artifacts
# (a .sql schema or query file IS tracked - only binary local DBs are ignored)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and IDEs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs and temporary files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BI tool temporary and backup files only
# The deliverables themselves (.pbix, .twb, .twbx, screenshots) ARE tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pbix.tmp
*.twbr
~$*.pbix
~$*.twb

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS and Office lock files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
~$*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately NOT ignored - these are portfolio deliverables and must be
# committed when they exist:
#   *.py  *.ipynb  *.sql  *.md  *.csv (documentation)
#   *.pbix  *.twb  *.twbx  dashboard screenshots (*.png / *.jpg)
#   src/  sql/  tests/  docs/
# Do not add broad patterns such as data/** or *.csv that would hide them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
